	GodRays: Rays
	GroundRing: Ring
	Sigil: Sigil
	PulseRing: Pulse
	Dye: Dye
	NoDye: no dye
	EffectsHint: Drawn right on the character, visible in the preview
	DyeHint: Dye recolors the halo, glow, rays and circles with a vanilla dye shader
	Color1: Main color
	Color2: Second color
	Themes: Color themes (for the selected part)
	CopyToAll: Copy to aura, trail and effects
	CopiedToAll: Colors copied to the whole look!
	SwapColors: Swap colors 1 and 2
	ReadyLooks: Ready looks
	LooksHint: Hover a look to read about it
	LooksTip: A look replaces your current settings. Save yours to a preset first!
	WardrobeHint: Hover an item. Recipes: Recipe Browser or the Guide
	Hue: Hue
	Saturation: Saturation
	Lightness: Brightness
	Rainbow: Rainbow

